msgstr "HomeProxy 更新目标"

msgid "Only the active ordinary SOCKS main_node whose address exactly matches this hostname is eligible. CFI writes only the top-ranked candidate to that one existing node; it never creates or copies nodes. The HomeProxy version and simple routing roles are checked again before every write."
msgstr "仅当活动普通 SOCKS main_node 的地址与此主机名完全一致时才可更新。CFI 只把排名第一的候选写入这一个已有节点，不会创建或复制节点。每次写入前都会重新检查 HomeProxy 版本和简单路由角色。"

msgid "Application Behavior"
msgstr "应用行为"

msgid "Configuration Apply"
msgstr "配置应用状态"

msgid "CFI persists the node address only. With stop_service disabled, an active HomeProxy is not stopped and the update remains pending. If you explicitly enable the maintenance stop in Settings, CFI restores HomeProxy after measurement; service startup is recorded, but target-domain egress is still unverified. No hard restart fallback is used."
msgstr "CFI 只持久化节点地址。关闭 stop_service 时不会停止运行中的 HomeProxy，更新会保持待应用。若在设置中明确启用维护停服，CFI 会在测量后恢复 HomeProxy；系统会记录服务恢复，但目标域名出站仍未经验证。不会使用硬重启回退。"

msgid "Unable to check HomeProxy environment"
msgstr "无法检查 HomeProxy 环境"

msgid "HomeProxy version is not qualified for CFI updates: %s"
msgstr "此 HomeProxy 版本未通过 CFI 更新验证：%s"

msgid "CFI only accepts the exact HomeProxy package version qualified by its isolated runtime test. No node configuration was changed."
msgstr "CFI 仅接受已通过隔离运行时测试的精确 HomeProxy 软件包版本。未更改任何节点配置。"

msgid "not installed"
msgstr "未安装"

msgid "unknown"
msgstr "未知"

