msgstr "维护停服后已恢复 HomeProxy，并加载写入活动 main_node 的排名第一候选；目标域名出站仍未经验证。"

msgid "Only the top candidate was persisted to one active HomeProxy main_node. The running service was not changed; runtime egress is unverified and application is pending."
msgstr "排名第一的候选仅已持久化到一个活动 HomeProxy main_node。运行中的服务未更改；运行时出站未经验证，更新仍待应用。"

