msgstr "PassWall2 版本未经 CFI 更新资格验证：%s"

msgid "CFI accepts only the exact PassWall2 package version qualified by its isolated guest. No node configuration was changed."
msgstr "CFI 仅接受在隔离虚拟机中通过验证的精确 PassWall2 软件包版本。没有修改节点配置。"

msgid "CFI parses the active global node and the complete static leaf/_shunt reference closure. It updates only one exact-matching SOCKS leaf using the top-ranked candidate. ACL roots, extra SOCKS services, chains, URLTest/balancing/interface nodes, batch nodes, unknown protocols, and invalid references fail closed."
msgstr "CFI 会解析当前全局节点及其完整的静态叶节点/_shunt 引用闭包。它只使用排名第一的候选更新一个精确匹配的 SOCKS 叶节点。ACL 根节点、额外 SOCKS 服务、链式节点、URLTest/负载均衡/接口节点、批量节点、未知协议和无效引用均会触发安全拒绝。"

msgid "CFI persists the selected address only. It does not call PassWall2 reload, restart, stop, or start from the transaction adapter. With stop_service disabled, an active service fails measurement before changes. If you explicitly allow a maintenance stop, CFI restores the original service before persisting the new address; service apply and target-domain egress remain unverified."
msgstr "CFI 仅持久化所选地址。事务适配器不会调用 PassWall2 reload、restart、stop 或 start。stop_service 关闭时，若服务正在运行，会在更改前拒绝测速。若显式允许维护停服，CFI 会先恢复原服务，再持久化新地址；服务是否应用及目标域名出站仍未验证。"

msgid "Only the top candidate was persisted to one active PassWall2 graph leaf. The service was not reloaded or restarted; runtime egress is unverified and application is pending."
msgstr "仅将排名第一的候选持久化到活动 PassWall2 节点图中的一个叶节点。服务未 reload 或 restart；运行态出站尚未验证，应用仍待处理。"

msgid "PassWall2 Apply Status"
msgstr "PassWall2 应用状态"

msgid "PassWall2 Update Target"
msgstr "PassWall2 更新目标"

msgid "The configured maintenance stop was recovered before the PassWall2 UCI write; the running service was not reloaded and the update remains pending."
msgstr "在写入 PassWall2 UCI 前，已恢复因维护操作而停止的服务；运行中服务未 reload，更新仍待应用。"

msgid "No supported proxy service is available. Install PassWall, PassWall2, OpenClash, or a qualified HomeProxy version before using this service."
msgstr "没有可用的受支持代理服务。请先安装 PassWall、PassWall2、OpenClash 或通过验证的 HomeProxy 版本。"

msgid "Installed PassWall2 version is not qualified for CFI persistence-only updates: %s"
