msgid "Update CFI"
msgstr "更新 CFI"

msgid "Update CFI from the unified feed? The page will reload after the package update."
msgstr "要从统一软件源更新 CFI 吗？软件包更新后页面会重新加载。"

msgid "CFI package update completed. Reloading."
msgstr "CFI 软件包更新完成，正在重新加载。"

msgid "Unable to update CFI from the unified feed."
msgstr "无法从统一软件源更新 CFI。"

msgid "Uses the trusted unified package feed."
msgstr "使用可信的统一软件源。"

msgid "Legacy CFI Update"
msgstr "旧版 CFI 更新"

msgid "Update CFI via legacy GitHub release"
msgstr "通过旧版 GitHub Release 更新 CFI"

msgid "Updating CFI..."
msgstr "正在更新 CFI..."

msgid "Legacy updater rejected the request."
msgstr "旧版更新器拒绝了该请求。"

msgid "Legacy CFI update started. Follow the package installer output on the router."
msgstr "旧版 CFI 更新已启动。请查看路由器上的软件包安装器输出。"

msgid "Unable to update CFI."
msgstr "无法更新 CFI。"

msgid "The legacy GitHub updater is used only because the unified package helper is missing."
msgstr "仅在缺少统一软件包管理组件时使用旧版 GitHub 更新器。"

msgid "Legacy GitHub updater is available because the unified package helper is missing."
msgstr "由于缺少统一软件包管理组件，可使用旧版 GitHub 更新器。"

msgid "Repair Rill Runtime"
msgstr "修复 Rill Runtime"

msgid "Repair"
msgstr "修复"

msgid "Repairing..."
msgstr "正在修复..."

msgid "Reinstall the same trusted Preview Runtime package to restore its missing executable? This will not upgrade the Runtime."
msgstr "要重新安装同版本且可信的 Preview Runtime 软件包以恢复缺失的可执行文件吗？此操作不会升级 Runtime。"

msgid "Runtime repair completed. Reloading status."
msgstr "Runtime 修复完成，正在刷新状态。"

msgid "Unable to repair Rill Runtime."
msgstr "无法修复 Rill Runtime。"

msgid "Reinstalls the same trusted Preview package only when its executable is missing. It does not change Runtime versions."
msgstr "仅当可执行文件缺失时重新安装相同版本的可信 Preview 软件包，不会更改 Runtime 版本。"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Legacy Preview Runtime is installed. Remove rill-runtime-preview, then install Stable rill-runtime."
msgstr "已安装旧版 Preview Runtime。请先卸载 rill-runtime-preview，再安装 Stable rill-runtime。"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Stable Runtime is installed."
msgstr "已安装 Stable Runtime。"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Install the optional Stable Rill Runtime? CFI Native mode will remain available."
msgstr "要安装可选的 Stable Rill Runtime 吗？CFI Native 模式仍可使用。"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Installs the package-managed Stable Runtime for this router release and architecture. A legacy Preview Runtime must be removed explicitly first."
msgstr "仅安装与此路由器版本和架构匹配的软件包管理版 Stable Runtime。必须先手动卸载旧版 Preview Runtime。"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Reinstall the same trusted Stable Runtime package to restore its missing executable? This will not upgrade the Runtime."
msgstr "要重新安装相同且可信的 Stable Runtime 软件包以恢复缺失的可执行文件吗？此操作不会升级 Runtime。"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Reinstalls the same trusted Stable package only when its executable is missing. It does not change Runtime versions."
msgstr "仅当可执行文件缺失时重新安装相同且可信的 Stable 软件包，不会更改 Runtime 版本。"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Update the shared Stable Rill Runtime? Other installed consumers will be checked before changes."
msgstr "要更新共享的 Stable Rill Runtime 吗？更改前会检查其他已安装的使用方。"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Updates only the compatible Stable Runtime. Unknown-source, legacy Preview, and incompatible installations are not replaced."
msgstr "仅更新兼容的 Stable Runtime。来源未知、旧版 Preview 或不兼容的安装不会被替换。"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Removing..."
msgstr "正在移除..."

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "卸载"

#: #: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Evaluation Freshness (seconds)"
msgstr "评估新鲜度（秒）"

#: #: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Evidence Expiry (seconds)"
msgstr "证据过期时间（秒）"

#: #: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Minimum Feedback Samples"
msgstr "最少反馈样本数"

#: #: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Safe Envelope Size"
msgstr "安全包络大小"

#: #: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Age at which the last comparable evaluation stops counting as "
"full-confidence evidence."
msgstr "最近一次可比评估超过该时长后，不再计入高置信度证据。"

#: #: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Age at which stale evidence expires and the run falls back to Native "
"selection. Must be at least the freshness window."
msgstr "陈旧证据超过该时长即过期，运行回退到 Native 选择。必须不小于评估新鲜度窗口。"

#: #: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Attributed feedback required before Assisted mode may take over. At one "
"run every six hours, 30 samples is roughly ten days; lowering it "
"shortens the wait and weakens the evidence."
msgstr "Assisted 模式接管前所需的有效反馈数。每 6 小时运行一次时，30 条约需十天；调低会缩短等待，也会削弱证据强度。"

#: #: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "How many leading Native candidates Assisted mode may reorder. Larger "
"values widen the search space and the possible regret."
msgstr "Assisted 模式可在多少个 Native 领先候选中重排。数值越大，可选空间与可能的损失同时增加。"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Evidence Freshness"
msgstr "证据新鲜度"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Expired"
msgstr "已过期"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Stale"
msgstr "陈旧"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "No evidence"
msgstr "暂无证据"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Guarded assisted"
msgstr "受保护协助"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Regression"
msgstr "性能回退"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Reset required"
msgstr "需要重置"

#: package/luci-app-cloudflare-ip/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/cloudflare-ip/intelligence.js
msgid "Fresh evidence keeps full confidence, stale evidence lowers it, expired "
"evidence falls back to Native selection."
msgstr "新鲜的证据保持完整置信度，陈旧证据降低置信度，过期证据回退到 Native 选择。"
